  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "Since 2026.3.3 went live on Oct 2 with the Unity 6 client, my world's framerate on Quest standalone has dropped sharply and consistently. Before the update the world ran a steady ~50-60 fps. Now it sits around 32 fps and dips as low as 12 fps. The world has an in-world fps sign with a low-framerate warning that rarely triggered before and now triggers regularly.\n\nQuest 3 visitors also occasionally get dropped from the world and have to rejoin.\n\nWorld:  https://vrchat.com/home/content/worlds/wrld_cdf2df8f-19e1-436f-8386-c56414f1dc99/edit",
